# Throne of the Grim Captain // The Grim Captain. The Throne's "{T}: Mill two cards" puts Rampaging Ferocidon (a Dinosaur)
# and Voldaren Epicure (a Vampire) into Bot1's graveyard. "Craft with a Dinosaur, a Merfolk, a Pirate, and a Vampire {4}"
# (CR 702.167a-b) needs four separate objects (the card's ruling): with Hullbreacher, a Merfolk Pirate, as the only Merfolk
# and the only Pirate it is not offered (refused); once Spyglass Siren, a Pirate, is out it is, each material asked for in
# turn - the Hullbreacher, chosen as the Merfolk, is not offered again as the Pirate (refused). The Grim Captain, a 7/7 with
# menace, trample, lifelink and hexproof, attacks on turn seven: Bot2 sacrifices a nonland permanent of its choice (its Mox
# Pearl, keeping the Ornithopter), and Bot1 puts Voldaren Epicure, an exiled creature card used to craft it (CR 702.167c),
# onto the battlefield tapped and attacking (CR 508.4); its enters ability deals 1 damage to Bot2. On turn nine Bot2
# sacrifices its last nonland permanent, the Ornithopter, and Bot1 puts nothing onto the battlefield (an empty choice).

